<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Feb 20.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Feb 20.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on February 20:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		 Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Onion		348/--- (LDD)   152/---  Pioneer Supreme  19/02</p>
<p>Garnet Sand    1,494/--- (LDD)   711/---  Arktis River     19/02</p>
<p>General	  1,431/--- (LDD) 1,194/---  Al Amin	    17/02</p>
<p>Wheat	   22,546/--- (ULD)17,454/---  Asian Excelsior  12/02</p>
<p>Logs		 575/--- (ULD) 6,097/---  Alexandros P     19/02</p>
<p>Coal	     1,750/--- (ULD)22,356/---  Tamil Periyar    20/02</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
